{
  "bodyHash": "GumV2H24SjU=",
  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">這到底是什麼鬼？Forge 版<br></span></h1><h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fcc-by-nc-sa-40\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-CC BY--NC--SA 4.0-blue.svg?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=creative-commons&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"授權條款\" width=\"230\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/pfZx8TXGpu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/711835441376264242?color=5865F2&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"161\" height=\"28\"></a></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wthit\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此獲得 Fabric 版本的祝福</a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badpackets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/1b/01/DfkvHGbQ_o.png\" alt=\"需要 Bad Packets\" width=\"168\" height=\"50\"></span></a></p><p><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">「我已經對模組開發失去興趣了。」</span>&nbsp;</strong></em>- TehNut</p><p style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Hwyla 已經 🦀！！ 現在我要怎麼玩 Minecraft 啊？？！！1！<br>別擔心，各位女士先生，我來罩你們了！</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">隆重介紹 <strong>WTHIT</strong></span> <span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">——由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hwyla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla</a>（原作者：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/TehNut\" rel=\"nofollow\">TehNut</a>）衍生而來，而 Hwyla 又是從 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waila\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila</a>（原作者：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/ProfMobius\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProfMobius</a>）衍生而來的模組</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">WTHIT 是一個能在遊戲中顯示玩家注視方塊（或流體）資訊的工具提示模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/24/15/jsEUqMnF_o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"58\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">它還提供 API，讓其他模組能為方塊添加更多資訊。</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">它能用於[填入次版本號]嗎？</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 應該可以。括號裡的數字是 WTHIT 編譯<strong>所基於</strong>的版本。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如果你有特殊需求（例如「拜託，快更新吧」），理論上它適用於任何次版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">這是個「僅安裝用戶端」的模組</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>並非如此</strong>。雖然某些簡單功能在僅客戶端也能運作，但部分進階功能需要伺服器也安裝此模組。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;需要存取 NBT 資料（例如容器內容）的功能，則可能需要在伺服器端安裝 WTHIT。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">聖光描述的圖片在哪裡？</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/cd/54/g9htZfk3_o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"719\" height=\"106\"><br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/5e/0a/rsyySZxw_o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#f00\">請在 GitHub 上回報問題，不要在留言區回報。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#f00\">留言區只用來告訴大家這個模組有多神聖。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
